# Avatar Kyoshi: "Lands you control have trample and hexproof" and "{T}: Add X mana of any one color, where X is the greatest power among creatures you
# control." Chapter III returns the Saga as Avatar Kyoshi on turn 5. Bot2's Strip Mine can no longer target Bot1's Forest (the 2/2 land creature chapter
# II made) - Bot1's lands have hexproof - and the Forest attacks with trample: Bot2's 0/1 Crimson Kobolds blocks, takes the one damage it needs and
# one tramples over (Bot2 is at 19). On turn 7 Avatar Kyoshi, no longer summoning sick, taps for five mana of one color: its own power of 5, the
# greatest among its creatures.

